[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4018899329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117037#issuecomment-4018899329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117037","id":4018899329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vi4mB","user":{"login":"Chaosus","id":3036176,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzYxNzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3036176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T11:43:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T11:43:37Z","body":"I guess this is not a bug, it's just misunderstanding of the preview feature - users need to understand that preview is not a tool which gather the uniforms from the material automagically.\n\nSame shader may be layed on different property slots (For 3d-surfaces they are: surface material for each surface, `material_override` and `material_overlay`).\nIf a user needs to get a copy from a `material_override` they need to use this option:\n\n<img width=\"1113\" height=\"865\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b65b9c99-5d71-48df-9235-6248a3529e27\" />\n\nFor current case copy/paste from a surface material is not supported currently and user must manually drag&drop the noise resource into preview parameter slots:\n\n<img width=\"1201\" height=\"1067\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63a7f3e4-800a-45ce-a596-0d35ee118df9\" />\n\n ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4018899329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4021265542","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117037#issuecomment-4021265542","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117037","id":4021265542,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vr6SG","user":{"login":"pbella","id":1817202,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTcyMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1817202?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella","html_url":"https://github.com/pbella","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pbella/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-09T05:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T05:31:01Z","body":"@Chaosus thanks for pointing out my mistake.  I'm pretty sure I have tripped over this at least once before so I'll just throw this out there:\n\n1) It seems like the need and process to set/copy parameters should be documented somewhere but I could find no mention at [https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/visual_shaders.html](url)\n\n2) As you mention, the copy parameters from material does not appear to work for my example... it would be nice if the limitations of copy feature were also documented somewhere.\n\nWith that said, it appears the remainder of my node preview issues may already be known issues (i.e. depth texture etc) so I think this one can be closed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4021265542/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]